# f9s UI stills for the README — render with: vhs vhs/ui-stills.tape
# Requires the playground running (make chaos / make playground).
Output vhs/_stills.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "./f9s"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Screenshot vhs/jobs.png
Type ":pulse"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Screenshot vhs/dashboard.png
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
